  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>What makes ExpressVPN stand out:</strong> Their proprietary Lightway protocol is optimized for speed without
    sacrificing security. ExpressVPN also excels in restricted countries—it's one of the few VPNs that reliably works in
    China.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Key features:</strong>
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>3,000+ servers in 105 countries:</strong> Comprehensive global coverage</li>
    <li><strong>Lightway protocol:</strong> Proprietary protocol optimized for speed and battery life</li>
    <li><strong>TrustedServer technology:</strong> RAM-only servers that can't store data</li>
