  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Minor drawbacks:</strong> Significantly more expensive than competitors. The 8-device limit may be
    restrictive for some users. No dedicated IP addresses available.
  </p>
  <AffiliateButton
      href="/go/expressvpn"
      text="Try ExpressVPN Risk-Free — 30-Day Guarantee"
      variant="primary"
      program="expressvpn"
