  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Speed test results:</strong> Surfshark performed well with a 15% average speed reduction. Performance was
    consistent across servers, though occasionally slower than NordVPN or ExpressVPN on distant servers.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Best for:</strong> Budget-conscious digital nomads, families, or anyone with many devices to protect. Great
